  "excerpt": "A tuna melt is a toasted open-face sandwich of tuna salad topped with melted cheese, grilled under the grill until bubbling and golden. The tuna salad is a mix of tinned tuna, mayonnaise, celery, and red onion. It is one of the defining American diner sandwiches.",
