  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The tuna salad base for a tuna melt is simply good tinned tuna drained very well, mixed with mayonnaise, a small amount of very finely chopped celery for crunch, and a little red onion. The mix needs to be well seasoned and slightly dry: a wet tuna salad makes the bread soggy before it can toast. Cheddar or emmental both work for the cheese."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
